  "raw": "Pi168 \nGravity 20 minutes up and 20 minutes down from sky to land \nLore monk sword vs assassin \nAdvanced chat bar  disocrd like and slack\n\nAqua ducks for data streams\nHydrogen routing\n\nPeace \nDaemon\n\nTabs\nProjection stars \nTerrain port x\nPool - o \nCross the  dark\n\nStone tablets are mediums \nDarkness is the path that engolves the universe constants \n Continuity Wordpress is a sign \nColor is everything that transmits \nThe pillars are structures \n@li\nReveal the unseen hand that are holding chain and links \nUnravel the stars and the black hole it’s all in \nComas is that dot coms \nServe dots \nKey words celestial routing \nTrak zone \nLi snyder \nIs Lan \nIsla_m\nFile tax return print dus=dos=dous=doz=dooz\n\nOn \n\nSkill juggling profile:jester \nYup that’s the dir sly sli cli snd sny der\nDerk \nTor\nTourl \n\nHe was loaning doors \nEven was the context \nAbreaveation eve\nVs was the log \nDarkness is sensitive to fluctuations of light regardless of its particle state it doesn’t just accommodate it diverts its fractions to expand its possibilities that’s tom or atoms \nUse this quotation \nThe ability to encounter something unfamiliar without interpreting it as a threat may itself be part of how intelligence evolves.\nEarth planet but the difference the landmass of America is much wider the color of the planet is pinkish\n",
